WEBVTT

01:38.140 --> 01:40.979
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.039 --> 01:43.950
[Episode 36]

01:45.479 --> 01:46.039
While

01:46.310 --> 01:47.430
I'm on leave,

01:47.759 --> 01:49.020
I'm taking your mother

01:49.229 --> 01:52.030
to the temple in Yuancheng Mountain for some rest.

01:52.070 --> 01:52.710
We

01:52.920 --> 01:54.250
will be back in ten days.

01:56.950 --> 01:57.640
Banxia,

01:58.310 --> 01:59.710
why don't you listen to me

02:00.150 --> 02:01.310
and come with us?

02:02.450 --> 02:02.890
I'm not going.

02:02.890 --> 02:04.740
It's too boring in the mountains.

02:04.740 --> 02:05.540
Alright then.

02:05.920 --> 02:07.150
Stay home

02:08.080 --> 02:09.280
and don't wander off.

02:10.110 --> 02:10.820
Got it.

02:11.360 --> 02:11.960
Just go.

02:13.120 --> 02:13.650
Alright.

02:17.710 --> 02:18.240
Banxia,

02:18.850 --> 02:20.250
don't cause any trouble.

02:30.530 --> 02:31.920
My Lady, look at that.

02:32.110 --> 02:33.770
That lantern is so beautiful.

02:37.240 --> 02:37.870
My Lady,

02:38.150 --> 02:38.960
look at this.

02:39.680 --> 02:40.410
Look at this.

02:41.560 --> 02:42.430
A lotus lantern.

02:42.430 --> 02:43.560
It's the latest design.

02:43.560 --> 02:44.680
It's so beautiful.

02:49.880 --> 02:50.750
My Lady, look.

02:55.280 --> 02:56.150
It's so pretty.

03:42.520 --> 03:43.200
My Lady.

03:47.680 --> 03:49.079
Are you alright, My Lady?

04:11.430 --> 04:12.000
Young lady,

04:11.660 --> 04:14.770
[Mr. Pu]

04:12.910 --> 04:14.040
come and take a look.

04:14.300 --> 04:16.160
See if there's anything you like.

04:36.430 --> 04:37.550
How much is this?

04:38.950 --> 04:39.830
I've already

04:40.100 --> 04:41.480
accepted money from your young lady

04:41.480 --> 04:42.360
once.

04:43.070 --> 04:44.950
I can't take it again.

04:47.360 --> 04:48.020
Young lady,

04:48.600 --> 04:50.070
the time has come

04:51.170 --> 04:53.360
for fate to unfold.

05:09.950 --> 05:10.740
Banxia,

05:11.540 --> 05:13.950
I think you've fallen for Xuanye.

05:14.390 --> 05:15.320
Do you know that?

05:21.950 --> 05:22.560
Banxia.

05:23.620 --> 05:30.520
♫Who forgot about the ups and downs of that long night's journey?♫

05:25.480 --> 05:26.080
Forget me.

05:31.010 --> 05:37.640
♫Leaving behind a pouring rain of love and hatred♫

05:38.500 --> 05:45.640
♫Who remembers what's deeply engraved by fate?♫

05:46.850 --> 05:53.370
♫A fleeting memory, yet love endures♫

05:59.900 --> 06:02.400
♫Wishing for a nice city♫

06:02.620 --> 06:06.220
♫To idle away♫

06:05.750 --> 06:06.430
Today,

06:06.430 --> 06:07.630
you must give me an answer.

06:07.480 --> 06:12.470
♫Waiting for a light that won't go out♫

06:07.830 --> 06:09.070
Will you accept

06:09.070 --> 06:09.950
me or not?

06:10.160 --> 06:11.270
Do you like me?

06:11.270 --> 06:13.000
Do you want to be with me?

06:13.310 --> 06:14.680
If I can't get an answer from you today,

06:14.680 --> 06:15.040
I...

06:15.080 --> 06:17.800
♫Seeing the moon rise and set♫

06:17.890 --> 06:21.480
♫Condensing the past all into tears♫

06:21.630 --> 06:22.240
Banxia,

06:21.850 --> 06:27.610
♫To reflect the passion glowing in my eyes♫

06:23.070 --> 06:23.870
in this world,

06:24.630 --> 06:26.270
nothing lasts forever.

06:28.240 --> 06:29.600
As time goes by,

06:30.190 --> 06:37.200
♫Who forgot about the ups and downs of that long night's journey?♫

06:30.630 --> 06:31.950
feelings will fade,

06:32.560 --> 06:34.290
or even disappear completely.

06:34.430 --> 06:35.800
You just need some time.

06:36.560 --> 06:37.620
After this period,

06:37.820 --> 06:43.880
♫Leaving behind a pouring rain of love and hatred♫

06:38.630 --> 06:40.030
everything will be fine.

06:45.020 --> 06:51.990
♫Who remembers what's deeply engraved by fate?♫

06:50.920 --> 06:51.680
Are you really not

06:51.680 --> 06:53.140
coming back to Guangping?

06:53.370 --> 06:58.970
♫A fleeting memory, yet love endures♫

06:54.270 --> 06:55.330
The journey is long

06:55.870 --> 06:57.200
and the trip isn't easy.

06:57.870 --> 06:59.130
I won't be coming back.

07:00.190 --> 07:02.040
My name is Jiu Xuanye.

07:03.320 --> 07:05.050
My name is Duan Banxia.

07:10.000 --> 07:10.680
My Lady.

07:13.810 --> 07:15.070
Xuanye. His name is...

07:16.260 --> 07:17.460
His name is Xuanye.

07:18.960 --> 07:19.680
Xuanye.

07:23.480 --> 07:24.120
Tingzhou.

07:27.150 --> 07:30.180
♫The beginning of love♫

07:28.360 --> 07:29.630
I remember now.

07:29.680 --> 07:30.950
His name is Xuanye!

07:34.070 --> 07:35.600
It's Xuanye!

07:34.730 --> 07:36.930
♫The return is yet unknown♫

07:37.050 --> 07:38.310
My Lady, what's wrong?

07:38.480 --> 07:39.920
Why did all of you

07:39.920 --> 07:40.920
forget about him?

07:42.320 --> 07:45.440
♫Through endless days and nights♫

07:43.000 --> 07:44.360
Who's Xuanye?

07:45.310 --> 07:46.430
It's Xuanye!

07:46.480 --> 07:47.310
Why did you all

07:47.390 --> 07:49.040
forget about him?

07:49.040 --> 07:49.630
My Lady.

07:49.700 --> 07:52.180
♫Where my heart leads me to♫

07:50.159 --> 07:50.820
Young lady,

07:53.750 --> 07:54.720
go now.

07:57.480 --> 08:04.380
♫Who is talking about never letting go of the memory♫

08:05.010 --> 08:11.700
♫Dreaming about the intertwined joy and sorrow♫

08:12.580 --> 08:19.700
♫Who knows the river of life winds through with twists and turns♫

08:20.510 --> 08:27.440
♫A fleeting memory, yet love endures♫

08:30.920 --> 08:31.480
Man Ying.

08:34.720 --> 08:35.320
Time to go.

08:56.390 --> 08:57.000
Sir.

08:58.440 --> 09:00.080
Take me to the Underground City.

09:00.080 --> 09:01.410
Do you have a pass token?

09:01.870 --> 09:02.480
No.

09:03.200 --> 09:04.060
But I have this.

09:04.270 --> 09:04.630
Here.

09:06.550 --> 09:07.350
This won't do.

09:07.530 --> 09:08.320
To enter the Underground City,

09:08.320 --> 09:09.550
you need a pass token.

09:10.960 --> 09:12.270
Please help me.

09:12.720 --> 09:13.360
These...

09:13.670 --> 09:14.470
are all yours.

09:15.390 --> 09:15.870
Here.

09:17.120 --> 09:17.720
I'm begging you.

09:17.720 --> 09:19.120
Please help me, will you?

09:19.360 --> 09:19.910
Well...

10:07.890 --> 10:09.180
I remember you now.

10:14.440 --> 10:15.200
Xuanye,

10:18.440 --> 10:19.840
I remember you now.

10:23.240 --> 10:24.030
Xuanye.

10:52.600 --> 10:53.150
It's been a long time

10:53.150 --> 10:54.550
since anyone lived here.

10:54.550 --> 10:55.810
I'll go clean up first.

11:02.270 --> 11:03.200
I'm not leaving.

11:03.840 --> 11:05.300
I'll be right in this room.

11:12.240 --> 11:14.380
It looks quite clean here.

11:14.810 --> 11:16.870
It seems like someone has cleaned it.

11:17.510 --> 11:18.360
Was it you?

11:21.960 --> 11:22.750
I used to

11:23.320 --> 11:25.120
come here to stay occasionally.

11:26.870 --> 11:28.670
Come here to stay occasionally?

11:30.020 --> 11:30.620
So,

11:30.650 --> 11:31.640
how long has it been

11:31.640 --> 11:32.900
since you remembered?

11:34.550 --> 11:36.120
Actually, as soon as I opened my eyes,

11:36.120 --> 11:37.580
I remembered everything.

11:38.750 --> 11:39.950
How is that possible?

11:40.200 --> 11:42.360
Didn't they say the Real-felicity Sword

11:42.360 --> 11:44.890
makes you forget everything with one strike?

11:45.150 --> 11:46.270
I don't know why.

11:47.190 --> 11:47.790
Maybe something

11:47.790 --> 11:49.190
happened in the process.

11:51.360 --> 11:52.220
What about you?

11:52.500 --> 11:53.700
How did you remember?

11:54.480 --> 11:55.360
Do you remember

11:55.360 --> 11:56.550
the old man

11:56.820 --> 11:58.210
who sold us the Echo Conch

11:58.210 --> 11:59.610
in the Underground City?

12:00.030 --> 12:01.480
I ran into him again.

12:02.100 --> 12:03.120
He gave me the Echo Conch back,

12:03.120 --> 12:04.810
exactly as it was.

12:05.080 --> 12:06.270
When I heard the sound inside,

12:06.270 --> 12:07.730
I remembered everything.

12:10.550 --> 12:11.600
The Echo Conch?

12:14.240 --> 12:16.390
So, you've been to Guangping before?

12:20.030 --> 12:20.750
Yes, I have.

12:22.960 --> 12:24.630
But didn't they say the Realm Gate

12:24.630 --> 12:26.320
opens once every 12 years?

12:28.360 --> 12:30.600
Our Mystic Panther Clan has a treasure

12:31.320 --> 12:32.710
that allows one clan member

12:32.710 --> 12:34.080
to freely pass through the Realm Gate

12:34.080 --> 12:35.510
and travel to the human world.

12:35.510 --> 12:37.750
Now that the Carefree Herb has withered,

12:37.750 --> 12:38.320
our clan

12:38.600 --> 12:39.750
needs someone

12:40.150 --> 12:42.120
to come to the human world to gather primordial spirits.

12:42.120 --> 12:42.960
So I came out.

12:45.960 --> 12:46.790
Then why

12:46.810 --> 12:48.270
didn't you come to find me?

12:56.390 --> 12:57.200
Actually,

12:58.360 --> 13:00.160
I've been by your side all along.

13:03.960 --> 13:05.870
When the Real-felicity Sword was drawn,

13:05.870 --> 13:07.070
everything changed.

13:07.910 --> 13:09.120
You all forgot me.

13:12.000 --> 13:13.750
But you remember everything.

13:17.700 --> 13:20.270
So, Jue Ming beneath the Matchmaking Tree

13:20.930 --> 13:22.130
said he had been there

13:22.130 --> 13:23.010
for many years.

13:23.080 --> 13:24.480
Was this also your doing?

13:26.870 --> 13:28.340
Since I knew in advance

13:28.360 --> 13:30.330
that some evil demons would harm people,

13:30.330 --> 13:31.730
how could I just stand by?

13:32.570 --> 13:33.480
I found

13:33.510 --> 13:35.170
the Moon-Fearing Demon early

13:35.390 --> 13:36.450
and eliminated it.

13:37.270 --> 13:39.270
I also found Manniang early as well.

13:40.100 --> 13:40.930
It's just that

13:41.360 --> 13:43.120
something happened in the process,

13:43.120 --> 13:44.080
and she escaped.

13:44.960 --> 13:47.020
I thought that with my intervention,

13:47.240 --> 13:49.040
she wouldn't meet your brother.

13:51.270 --> 13:52.670
After Chi Wangchuan died,

13:52.670 --> 13:54.150
Ji Li aged instantly.

13:54.750 --> 13:56.610
She left the Yunmen Dance Troupe.

13:56.910 --> 13:58.710
As for where she went after that,

13:58.790 --> 13:59.720
I don't know.

14:02.840 --> 14:05.300
Constable Yan Li from the government office

14:05.550 --> 14:06.610
didn't die either.

14:07.120 --> 14:08.080
So,

14:08.600 --> 14:10.190
you also went to the Reunion Inn

14:10.190 --> 14:11.390
and met Feng Wuniang?

14:13.200 --> 14:13.720
Yes.

14:14.680 --> 14:15.480
Though I stopped

14:15.480 --> 14:17.140
Feng Wuniang from doing evil,

14:17.150 --> 14:18.320
I didn't expect that

14:18.840 --> 14:21.240
Qingshan's demon nature wouldn't change.

14:22.000 --> 14:22.750
After I left,

14:23.280 --> 14:24.880
to save Feng Tian, Nine Lives

14:24.960 --> 14:27.090
traded his lives for money in the city.

14:27.390 --> 14:29.450
He even went to ask my father for help.

14:29.480 --> 14:30.610
When I rushed there,

14:31.200 --> 14:32.600
I found that Feng Wuniang

14:32.600 --> 14:34.660
had already been killed by Qingshan.

14:34.790 --> 14:35.520
And Qingshan

14:36.000 --> 14:37.330
was killed by Feng Tian.

14:38.390 --> 14:39.650
What about Nine Lives?

14:41.060 --> 14:42.710
Nine Lives sacrificed himself again

14:42.710 --> 14:43.920
to save Feng Tian.

14:52.360 --> 14:53.090
Xingxian...

14:53.510 --> 14:55.240
Xingxian was saved by you too?

14:56.720 --> 14:58.520
Aren't you the one who saved her?

14:58.860 --> 15:00.310
I just helped her a couple of times

15:00.310 --> 15:01.380
by coincidence.

15:02.240 --> 15:03.790
Even a small change

15:04.080 --> 15:05.880
can lead to a different outcome.

15:06.140 --> 15:07.530
You scolded Xingxian,

15:08.030 --> 15:09.320
and that woke her up.

15:10.120 --> 15:11.130
She went to the government office

15:11.130 --> 15:12.010
to sue Zhang Pu

15:12.440 --> 15:13.640
and ask for a divorce.

15:14.240 --> 15:15.300
Did Zhang Pu agree?

15:15.770 --> 15:17.020
Of course not.

15:18.360 --> 15:19.870
But Chilian has been in Guangping

15:19.870 --> 15:20.800
for so many years

15:21.030 --> 15:22.690
and has some influence there.

15:22.840 --> 15:25.240
Plus, Lord Geng from the government office

15:25.440 --> 15:26.320
is quite fair,

15:26.750 --> 15:28.810
so he ruled in favor of their divorce.

15:29.600 --> 15:30.600
Chilian even found a job

15:30.600 --> 15:31.550
for Xingxian.

15:32.110 --> 15:32.960
This time,

15:33.200 --> 15:34.630
it shouldn't end

15:34.630 --> 15:35.750
as badly as before.

15:37.140 --> 15:37.720
Didn't you

15:37.720 --> 15:39.270
dislike Xingxian before?

15:40.000 --> 15:41.130
Why did you help her?

15:43.290 --> 15:44.550
She's not a bad person.

15:45.550 --> 15:46.350
It's just that

15:46.550 --> 15:47.550
in her suffering,

15:47.890 --> 15:49.690
she lost her kindness bit by bit.

15:50.360 --> 15:52.020
But for what happened before,

15:52.400 --> 15:55.000
Chilian can't be absolved of responsibility.

15:57.240 --> 15:58.000
So,

15:58.670 --> 16:00.240
you saved everyone.

16:03.360 --> 16:04.390
I did

16:05.030 --> 16:05.760
what I could.

16:10.630 --> 16:11.890
What about Shen Tunan?

16:12.200 --> 16:13.200
Have you seen him?

16:14.960 --> 16:15.600
I have.

16:16.480 --> 16:18.340
He didn't go to the Carefree Land.

16:18.510 --> 16:19.270
He's just

16:19.510 --> 16:20.750
an ordinary

16:20.750 --> 16:21.750
demon hunter now.

16:22.850 --> 16:24.050
But just like before,

16:24.600 --> 16:26.080
any demon in his hands

16:26.320 --> 16:27.450
can't escape death.

16:28.910 --> 16:30.310
I disciplined him twice.

16:31.030 --> 16:33.200
And with my father's restrictions,

16:33.980 --> 16:35.120
he's become much more restrained

16:35.120 --> 16:36.000
over the years.

16:40.480 --> 16:41.680
I'm glad to hear that.

16:44.390 --> 16:45.250
What about you?

16:50.790 --> 16:51.790
Are you happy

16:52.630 --> 16:53.630
being He Quelian?

17:00.240 --> 17:00.960
I...

17:02.080 --> 17:03.540
can't see demons anymore.

17:04.440 --> 17:07.000
Now I just eat, drink, and have fun every day.

17:09.480 --> 17:10.940
I've been going to school,

17:12.119 --> 17:14.180
and I even learned how to ride a horse.

17:14.440 --> 17:16.030
And my father found a martial arts master

17:16.030 --> 17:16.960
to teach me.

17:18.030 --> 17:19.400
I may not be as good as you,

17:19.400 --> 17:20.270
but I'm not bad.

17:28.830 --> 17:30.510
But for some reason,

17:32.640 --> 17:34.120
I just felt unhappy.

17:40.440 --> 17:43.100
It was like there was a piece missing in my heart.

17:44.400 --> 17:46.730
There was something I couldn't remember,

17:47.160 --> 17:48.760
but I didn't know what it was.

18:13.820 --> 18:14.540
Xuanye,

18:22.510 --> 18:24.420
can you not leave me?

19:04.730 --> 19:05.620
Xuanye...

19:13.650 --> 19:14.370
I'm sorry.

19:25.760 --> 19:26.510
My Lady.

19:27.780 --> 19:29.380
My Lady, where have you been?

19:29.450 --> 19:30.350
I've been looking for you all night.

19:30.350 --> 19:31.550
I even went to the government office.

19:31.550 --> 19:32.240
Chief Constable Chu is leading

19:32.240 --> 19:33.790
the entire government office in search of you.

19:33.790 --> 19:34.890
If we can't find you today,

19:34.890 --> 19:36.750
I'll have to notify His Lordship.

19:37.000 --> 19:37.440
Alright.

19:37.440 --> 19:38.880
I'm back now, aren't I?

19:39.880 --> 19:41.210
If you had gone missing,

19:41.790 --> 19:43.640
His Lordship would've scolded me to death.

19:43.640 --> 19:44.680
Go to the government office now

19:44.680 --> 19:46.480
and let Chief Constable Chu and the others know I'm safe.

19:46.480 --> 19:48.140
Don't let them worry anymore.

19:48.440 --> 19:49.500
I'll go right away.

19:56.590 --> 19:57.310
Go now.

19:58.000 --> 19:58.730
Come with me.

20:12.270 --> 20:14.180
No one has lived there for a long time.

20:14.180 --> 20:16.110
Only Chi Xue goes up occasionally.

20:18.820 --> 20:19.750
Uncle Jiu knows

20:19.780 --> 20:21.270
the rules of the Real-felicity Sword.

20:21.270 --> 20:23.070
You could reveal yourself to him.

20:23.070 --> 20:24.170
Fate has changed.

20:24.650 --> 20:26.510
They've long forgotten about me.

20:26.960 --> 20:27.790
Telling him

20:28.590 --> 20:30.520
would only cause him more trouble.

20:31.440 --> 20:33.210
But if you say it,

20:33.240 --> 20:35.040
he will definitely believe you.

20:36.200 --> 20:37.660
Our connections are gone.

20:38.550 --> 20:39.810
Even if he believes me,

20:40.200 --> 20:42.260
things won't return to how they were.

20:46.510 --> 20:47.240
But at least,

20:49.270 --> 20:51.270
you've remembered everything now.

20:51.350 --> 20:52.310
That's

20:52.510 --> 20:54.070
the greatest gift to me.

20:54.720 --> 20:55.350
I dare not

20:56.070 --> 20:57.350
ask for more.

21:00.350 --> 21:01.060
Gift...

21:03.830 --> 21:04.630
That's right.

21:06.220 --> 21:07.060
I gained

21:07.090 --> 21:09.120
12 years of time for no reason

21:09.720 --> 21:11.350
and learned so many skills.

21:11.680 --> 21:13.880
Now I'm good at both literature and martial arts.

21:13.880 --> 21:15.410
Pretty impressive, right?

21:17.850 --> 21:19.890
Yes, of course.

21:20.640 --> 21:21.960
Your literary talent is exceptional,

21:21.960 --> 21:23.070
your martial arts skills are remarkable,

21:23.070 --> 21:24.440
and you're great at cooking.

21:24.440 --> 21:25.770
It's truly impressive.

21:27.790 --> 21:29.450
But you've never seen me cook.

22:06.030 --> 22:06.830
What's wrong?

22:09.000 --> 22:09.750
Xuanye,

22:11.830 --> 22:13.270
let's go out for a walk.

22:15.270 --> 22:16.000
Sure.

22:16.750 --> 22:18.010
Where do you want to go?

22:18.790 --> 22:21.000
Let's go to the places we went before.

22:23.240 --> 22:25.570
Let's go to Yanlai Restaurant for drinks,

22:26.640 --> 22:28.500
to Fa'en Temple to offer incense,

22:30.070 --> 22:31.640
fish by the lake,

22:33.560 --> 22:36.000
visit Mrs. Yu's dessert shop,

22:37.110 --> 22:39.110
and buy some snacks at Sanyuan Shop.

22:42.880 --> 22:43.740
In short,

22:45.330 --> 22:46.640
let's just stroll around

22:46.640 --> 22:48.100
Guangping City together,

22:48.880 --> 22:50.400
just the two of us.

22:53.070 --> 22:53.720
Alright.

22:54.920 --> 22:56.440
Let's enjoy ourselves

22:57.480 --> 22:58.510
together.

22:59.340 --> 23:02.590
♫When you're in love, your smile is like the spring breeze♫

23:03.220 --> 23:06.380
♫Walking beside me, bathed in moonlight♫

23:07.080 --> 23:10.590
♫No need for words, I already feel it♫

23:10.620 --> 23:14.150
♫Dark hair like ink, time stretches on♫

23:14.680 --> 23:18.060
♫When you're in love, you wish this love could last forever♫

23:18.470 --> 23:21.400
♫Leaning in close to whisper softly♫

23:21.660 --> 23:23.990
♫I miss you♫

23:24.230 --> 23:26.100
♫On every moonlit night♫

23:26.200 --> 23:30.480
♫Tenderness ties us together♫

23:31.730 --> 23:35.480
♫Let me take your hand and keep our promise♫

23:35.740 --> 23:38.980
♫You shake my soul and pull at my heartstrings♫

23:39.560 --> 23:41.430
♫If I think this world is beautiful♫

23:41.460 --> 23:43.180
♫It's partly because of the moon♫

23:43.320 --> 23:46.790
♫And mostly because I met you♫

23:47.280 --> 23:50.740
♫When life gets hard♫

23:51.230 --> 23:54.310
♫All I wish for is to stay by your side♫

23:54.850 --> 23:56.700
♫This lingering love♫

23:56.720 --> 23:58.720
♫Is a treasure we both cherish♫

23:58.740 --> 24:01.430
♫When I turn around, you're there♫

24:01.530 --> 24:04.180
♫Right by my side♫

24:17.860 --> 24:21.240
♫When you're in love, your smile is like the spring breeze♫

24:21.810 --> 24:25.040
♫Walking beside me, bathed in moonlight♫

24:25.560 --> 24:29.110
♫No need for words, I already feel it♫

24:29.410 --> 24:32.540
♫Dark hair like ink, time stretches on♫

24:30.030 --> 24:31.290
A match made in heaven!

24:32.030 --> 24:32.960
Here's the reward:

24:32.960 --> 24:34.680
a lantern!

24:33.170 --> 24:36.600
♫When you're in love, you wish this love could last forever♫

24:35.590 --> 24:36.110
Here.

24:36.880 --> 24:39.860
♫Leaning in close to whisper softly♫

24:40.200 --> 24:42.610
♫I miss you♫

24:42.760 --> 24:44.370
♫On every moonlit night♫

24:44.650 --> 24:49.120
♫Tenderness ties us together♫

24:50.220 --> 24:54.010
♫Let me take your hand and keep our promise♫

24:54.210 --> 24:57.550
♫You shake my soul and pull at my heartstrings♫

24:58.080 --> 25:00.000
♫If I think this world is beautiful♫

25:00.030 --> 25:01.810
♫It's partly because of the moon♫

25:01.830 --> 25:05.090
♫And mostly because I met you♫

25:05.650 --> 25:09.180
♫When life gets hard♫

25:09.530 --> 25:12.810
♫All I wish for is to stay by your side♫

25:13.380 --> 25:15.270
♫This lingering love♫

25:15.290 --> 25:17.200
♫Is a treasure we both cherish♫

25:17.220 --> 25:19.900
♫When I turn around, you're there♫

25:19.910 --> 25:24.090
[Hongxiu Pavilion]

25:20.080 --> 25:22.570
♫Right by my side♫

25:37.960 --> 25:39.220
What wish did you make?

25:41.420 --> 25:42.880
I hope there's a heavy snowfall

25:42.880 --> 25:44.240
in Guangping.

25:45.960 --> 25:46.590
Why?

25:48.310 --> 25:49.510
Haven't you heard?

25:50.960 --> 25:52.120
The elders say

25:52.200 --> 25:54.030
that if two people in love

25:54.290 --> 25:55.690
share a snowfall,

25:56.240 --> 25:57.590
they'll grow old together

25:57.590 --> 25:58.650
and never be apart.

26:00.720 --> 26:02.680
But it rarely snows in Guangping.

26:03.660 --> 26:04.790
Even if it does,

26:04.960 --> 26:07.440
the snow will melt as soon as it hits the ground,

26:07.440 --> 26:09.640
let alone turning anyone's hair white.

26:17.790 --> 26:18.650
What about you?

26:19.480 --> 26:20.920
What wish did you make?

26:23.830 --> 26:24.880
I wished that

26:25.440 --> 26:26.880
you would have a smooth life,

26:26.880 --> 26:27.940
free from worries,

26:28.310 --> 26:29.770
and live happily forever.

26:32.300 --> 26:33.620
That's three wishes.

26:33.790 --> 26:35.000
You're so greedy.

26:36.790 --> 26:37.350
Yes.

26:38.180 --> 26:38.980
I am so greedy.

26:48.880 --> 26:49.550
Xuanye.

26:55.710 --> 26:56.860
I like you so much.

26:58.510 --> 26:59.790
Can you not leave?

27:14.960 --> 27:16.220
I was just saying that.

27:16.830 --> 27:18.520
I just saw Sanyuan Shop.

27:18.640 --> 27:20.300
I'll go and buy some pastries.

27:51.320 --> 27:52.830
I hope there's a heavy snowfall

27:52.830 --> 27:54.070
in Guangping.

27:55.790 --> 27:57.550
If two people in love

27:57.720 --> 27:59.160
share a snowfall,

27:59.870 --> 28:01.070
they'll grow old together

28:01.070 --> 28:02.130
and never be apart.

28:23.890 --> 28:27.500
♫Just sobered up after a dream, sighing for my life♫

28:27.530 --> 28:30.400
♫In this desolate mortal world♫

28:31.090 --> 28:33.430
♫The other side sees fantasies fading into obscurity♫

28:33.450 --> 28:37.220
♫Is it a blessing or a calamity?♫

28:39.570 --> 28:41.520
♫I'm all alone♫

28:41.540 --> 28:43.420
♫Braving the snowstorm♫

28:43.440 --> 28:46.100
♫Struck by sudden amnesia♫

28:46.810 --> 28:49.220
♫Wait until the last peach blossom falls♫

28:49.240 --> 28:57.050
♫Glance back with love for 10,000 years♫

28:57.120 --> 28:59.110
♫If there were no regrets♫

28:59.130 --> 29:01.120
♫Why would the starlight still remain♫

29:01.150 --> 29:04.140
♫To illuminate the world?♫

29:04.560 --> 29:08.200
♫Coated in starlight, holding gleaming swords♫

29:08.800 --> 29:12.450
♫Before daybreak♫

29:12.540 --> 29:14.480
♫May you have no regrets♫

29:14.500 --> 29:16.070
♫Together, through seas and mountains♫

29:16.100 --> 29:19.940
♫If all must fade away and be forgotten♫

29:20.330 --> 29:22.560
♫I'd keep it all to myself♫

29:22.610 --> 29:24.470
♫If we luck out♫

29:22.650 --> 29:24.850
[Hongxiu Pavilion]

29:24.490 --> 29:30.260
♫Let's reunite once again beyond the time♫

29:43.950 --> 29:45.940
♫If there were no regrets♫

29:45.960 --> 29:47.950
♫Why would the starlight still remain♫

29:47.980 --> 29:50.970
♫To illuminate the world?♫

29:51.390 --> 29:55.030
♫Coated in starlight, holding gleaming swords♫

29:55.630 --> 29:59.280
♫Before daybreak♫

29:59.370 --> 30:01.310
♫May you have no regrets♫

30:01.330 --> 30:02.900
♫Together, through seas and mountains♫

30:02.930 --> 30:06.770
♫If all must fade away and be forgotten♫

30:07.160 --> 30:09.390
♫I'd keep it all to myself♫

30:09.440 --> 30:11.300
♫If we luck out♫

30:11.320 --> 30:17.090
♫Let's reunite once again beyond the time♫

30:22.310 --> 30:23.030
Xuanye,

30:26.070 --> 30:27.920
let's treat everyone to a meal.

30:29.350 --> 30:29.880
A meal?

30:33.890 --> 30:35.880
♫If there were no regrets♫

30:35.900 --> 30:37.890
♫Why would the starlight still remain♫

30:36.440 --> 30:37.700
Let's invite everyone

30:37.920 --> 30:40.910
♫To illuminate the world?♫

30:41.330 --> 30:44.970
♫Coated in starlight, holding gleaming swords♫

30:42.480 --> 30:44.140
and have a happy meal together

30:45.570 --> 30:49.220
♫Before daybreak♫

30:45.750 --> 30:48.160
before you leave. Alright.

30:49.310 --> 30:51.250
♫May you have no regrets♫

30:51.270 --> 30:52.840
♫Together, through seas and mountains♫

30:52.830 --> 30:53.510
Okay.

30:52.870 --> 30:56.710
♫If all must fade away and be forgotten♫

30:57.100 --> 30:59.330
♫I'd keep it all to myself♫

30:59.380 --> 31:01.240
♫If we luck out♫

31:01.260 --> 31:12.010
♫Let's reunite once again beyond the time♫

31:19.700 --> 31:20.480
Banxia,

31:20.640 --> 31:22.000
what's the occasion today?

31:22.000 --> 31:23.260
Why such a grand setup?

31:24.030 --> 31:25.240
This is to thank you

31:25.240 --> 31:26.770
for looking for me that day.

31:27.510 --> 31:28.440
It's no big deal.

31:29.180 --> 31:30.960
You're the daughter of Secretary Duan.

31:30.960 --> 31:31.680
Helping you

31:32.070 --> 31:33.070
is the least we could do.

31:33.070 --> 31:33.920
Look at him.

31:34.030 --> 31:35.100
I'm not like him.

31:35.480 --> 31:36.480
With our friendship,

31:36.480 --> 31:37.070
even if you

31:37.070 --> 31:38.130
weren't the daughter of Secretary Duan,

31:38.130 --> 31:39.070
I would have still

31:39.070 --> 31:39.680
gone to find you.

31:39.680 --> 31:41.210
You have a sweet mouth, huh?

31:45.920 --> 31:46.990
And who is this?

31:49.360 --> 31:50.120
He's...

31:50.310 --> 31:51.160
my friend.

31:52.100 --> 31:53.050
Your friend?

31:53.450 --> 31:55.450
How come I've never seen him before?

31:57.030 --> 31:57.960
Hello, my name

31:58.240 --> 31:59.040
is Jiu Xuanye.

31:59.420 --> 32:00.420
I'm from Jingchu.

32:00.780 --> 32:02.400
I'm here in Guangping for business.

32:02.400 --> 32:03.590
You're from Jingchu?

32:03.590 --> 32:04.750
You speak Guangping dialect

32:04.750 --> 32:05.750
very well.

32:08.240 --> 32:09.700
You're here for business?

32:10.480 --> 32:12.170
But Jingchu is far from here.

32:13.040 --> 32:14.480
Most merchants from Jingchu stop in Shendu

32:14.480 --> 32:15.940
and don't travel further.

32:16.400 --> 32:17.550
Very few of them

32:17.960 --> 32:19.020
come to Guangping.

32:20.640 --> 32:21.240
Youhuang,

32:21.440 --> 32:22.750
today, we're here to eat,

32:22.750 --> 32:24.210
not to investigate a case.

32:24.330 --> 32:25.190
Don't mind him.

32:25.270 --> 32:26.000
I am Wen Jian,

32:26.160 --> 32:27.400
the Chief Constable of Guangping.

32:27.400 --> 32:28.590
This is my colleague,

32:28.590 --> 32:29.390
Chu Youhuang.

32:30.750 --> 32:31.750
Chief Constable Wen.

32:31.750 --> 32:32.950
Chief Constable Chu.

32:32.960 --> 32:33.560
Oh, right.

32:33.730 --> 32:34.720
I have another distinguished guest

32:34.720 --> 32:36.320
I'd like to introduce to you.

32:36.480 --> 32:36.960
This is

32:36.960 --> 32:38.200
Sima Lingying, the judicial commissioner

32:38.200 --> 32:39.260
from the Court of Judicial Review.

32:39.260 --> 32:40.520
She was sent by the Minister of the Court of Judicial Review

32:40.520 --> 32:41.650
on official business to our city.

32:41.650 --> 32:43.830
She is the superior of me and Youhuang.

32:44.240 --> 32:44.720
Banxia,

32:44.920 --> 32:45.830
I don't think you've met Lady Sima yet,

32:45.830 --> 32:46.510
have you?

32:50.110 --> 32:50.640
No,

32:51.440 --> 32:52.160
I haven't.

32:52.880 --> 32:54.310
Don't listen to his nonsense.

32:54.310 --> 32:55.590
I'm just a minor official,

32:55.590 --> 32:57.650
hardly worthy of being called a Lady.

32:58.200 --> 32:59.590
I'm a friend of Chu Youhuang.

32:59.590 --> 33:00.190
Everyone,

33:00.400 --> 33:02.060
please just call me Lingying.

33:02.270 --> 33:03.530
Hello, Miss Lingying.

33:05.270 --> 33:06.270
Then, shall we...

33:07.110 --> 33:08.350
Please, sit down.

33:09.220 --> 33:10.280
Lady Sima, please.

33:10.440 --> 33:11.040
After you.

33:16.960 --> 33:17.690
Please, sit.

33:22.160 --> 33:22.680
Banxia,

33:22.950 --> 33:24.170
I see there's a heater roasting meat.

33:24.170 --> 33:25.370
Did you prepare wine?

33:26.400 --> 33:29.470
We prepared wine from Huang Village. Is it strong enough?

33:29.470 --> 33:29.960
Jiu,

33:29.960 --> 33:32.220
you look like someone who knows his wine.

33:32.230 --> 33:33.720
The wine from Huang Village here

33:33.720 --> 33:35.060
is my favorite.

33:44.160 --> 33:44.890
New clothes.

33:45.000 --> 33:45.730
How do I look?

33:45.960 --> 33:46.760
Do I look good?

33:47.670 --> 33:48.950
Who invited you here?

33:50.590 --> 33:51.270
Xuanye.

33:53.510 --> 33:54.640
You know each other?

33:58.590 --> 34:00.320
What's his background anyway?

34:01.000 --> 34:01.550
He...

34:02.070 --> 34:03.000
I don't think

34:03.200 --> 34:05.000
he looks like a proper merchant.

34:05.570 --> 34:07.170
Why are you asking about him?

34:07.350 --> 34:09.070
I'm asking for my young lady.

34:09.909 --> 34:10.510
I don't know

34:10.510 --> 34:11.480
what kind of spell

34:11.480 --> 34:13.010
he has cast on my young lady.

34:13.030 --> 34:14.440
They've only known each other for a few days,

34:14.440 --> 34:16.150
and they're already inseparable.

34:16.150 --> 34:17.030
When my master

34:17.030 --> 34:17.980
and madam return,

34:17.980 --> 34:19.110
they'll be furious.

34:21.739 --> 34:23.139
Let me take it over there.

34:27.360 --> 34:28.190
Here it comes!

34:30.100 --> 34:30.889
Thank you.

34:30.920 --> 34:32.320
Come, sit and eat with us.

34:32.510 --> 34:33.570
Smells delicious.

34:34.000 --> 34:34.630
Here, Jiu.

34:34.770 --> 34:35.630
Your favorite.

34:35.710 --> 34:36.170
Banxia,

34:36.510 --> 34:37.170
pork belly.

34:37.630 --> 34:39.400
Jiu, how long have you been in Guangping?

34:39.400 --> 34:41.199
Are you planning to stay longer?

34:42.150 --> 34:43.610
I've been here for a while.

34:44.000 --> 34:44.760
But I've almost finished

34:44.760 --> 34:45.960
what I came here to do.

34:46.070 --> 34:47.270
I'll be leaving soon.

34:54.800 --> 34:55.320
Jiu,

34:56.480 --> 34:58.190
I heard that in the past two years, Jingchu has suffered

34:58.190 --> 34:59.030
a spring drought, a summer flood,

34:59.030 --> 35:00.230
and a great disaster.

35:00.360 --> 35:01.440
Even with the imperial court's aid,

35:01.440 --> 35:03.100
it's just a drop in the bucket.

35:03.150 --> 35:05.010
Has your hometown been affected?

35:06.280 --> 35:07.030
These years

35:07.320 --> 35:08.840
have been tough for everyone.

35:08.840 --> 35:10.570
Everyone is having a hard time.

35:10.630 --> 35:13.090
But solutions are always devised by people.

35:13.280 --> 35:14.440
As long as we keep going

35:14.440 --> 35:15.240
and work hard,

35:15.590 --> 35:16.790
we'll make it through

35:17.230 --> 35:18.280
and see the light

35:18.760 --> 35:20.090
at the end of the tunnel.

35:20.710 --> 35:21.510
That's right.

35:22.440 --> 35:24.400
A major disaster doesn't last more than three years.

35:24.400 --> 35:26.550
Think about how difficult it was for every founding emperor

35:26.550 --> 35:28.110
to establish their dynasty.

35:28.110 --> 35:29.880
Which of them didn't start from nothing?

35:29.880 --> 35:30.710
But now,

35:31.320 --> 35:32.030
haven't they all ended up

35:32.030 --> 35:33.620
living comfortable and prosperous lives?

35:33.620 --> 35:35.480
Could our hardships be worse than theirs?

35:35.480 --> 35:36.480
As long as we persist

35:36.480 --> 35:37.710
and keep working hard,

35:37.710 --> 35:39.310
there will be a good outcome.

35:39.880 --> 35:40.480
Remember,

35:41.400 --> 35:42.920
man can always conquer nature.

35:42.920 --> 35:43.590
Well said.

35:44.110 --> 35:44.630
Here!

35:45.190 --> 35:46.920
Man can always conquer nature.

35:53.630 --> 35:54.230
Tingzhou,

35:54.800 --> 35:55.760
come and eat some.

35:55.760 --> 35:56.960
I'll do the roasting.

35:57.720 --> 35:58.590
Here, Jiu.

35:58.590 --> 35:59.450
Let me help you.

36:14.280 --> 36:14.840
Banxia,

36:16.240 --> 36:17.670
what's your relationship

36:17.670 --> 36:18.590
with Mr. Jiu?

36:22.850 --> 36:23.580
Don't worry.

36:23.840 --> 36:25.240
I won't tell your father.

36:25.760 --> 36:27.360
Didn't I just tell you?

36:29.030 --> 36:30.030
That was not true.

36:31.760 --> 36:33.320
I can tell you and Mr. Jiu

36:33.880 --> 36:35.410
are more than just friends.

36:37.280 --> 36:38.140
What about you?

36:38.800 --> 36:40.440
Are you just friends

36:40.710 --> 36:42.030
with Chu?

36:42.670 --> 36:43.360
Banxia,

36:44.800 --> 36:46.400
Commissioner and I

36:47.280 --> 36:48.670
are truly just friends.

36:50.710 --> 36:51.230
See?

36:51.680 --> 36:52.840
This is their first meeting,

36:52.840 --> 36:54.110
and she can already tell.

36:54.110 --> 36:55.970
Yet you're still putting on airs.

36:56.230 --> 36:56.840
Lady Sima,

36:57.440 --> 36:58.230
if you ask me,

36:58.530 --> 36:59.760
there are plenty of young men

36:59.760 --> 37:00.440
in our government office.

37:00.440 --> 37:01.770
Don't just stick to one.

37:09.280 --> 37:09.710
Here.

37:12.920 --> 37:13.520
Everyone,

37:13.760 --> 37:15.020
let me propose a toast.

37:17.230 --> 37:18.590
Today, we met Xuanye

37:18.920 --> 37:20.190
and made a new friend.

37:21.030 --> 37:22.290
Banxia is safely home.

37:22.920 --> 37:23.590
Lady Sima

37:23.590 --> 37:25.200
has been transferred to Guangping City.

37:25.200 --> 37:26.110
And it seems like Youhuang

37:26.110 --> 37:27.630
is about to start a family.

37:27.650 --> 37:28.630
What are you talking about?

37:28.630 --> 37:29.280
Well said.

37:29.760 --> 37:30.670
Four joys have come to us all at once.

37:30.670 --> 37:31.130
Come on,

37:31.280 --> 37:31.940
bottoms up!

37:32.190 --> 37:32.750
Here!

37:37.360 --> 37:38.590
Eat up. Have more meat.

37:38.590 --> 37:39.070
Let's roast more.

37:39.070 --> 37:40.870
The meat skewers have gone cold.

37:41.000 --> 37:42.200
Thank you, Lady Sima.

37:42.710 --> 37:43.640
It's for Banxia.

37:43.800 --> 37:45.280
Two!

37:45.440 --> 37:46.760
Eight!

37:47.030 --> 37:48.510
Drink up!

37:48.710 --> 37:51.110
Four! Five!

37:51.280 --> 37:51.810
Drink up!

37:53.030 --> 37:53.630
Drink up!

37:54.360 --> 37:54.760
That's right.

37:54.760 --> 37:55.340
Lady Sima,

37:55.340 --> 37:56.870
how can you avoid drinking?

37:57.280 --> 37:57.740
Xuanye.

37:58.710 --> 37:59.230
Another round.

37:59.230 --> 37:59.690
Come on.

38:00.840 --> 38:01.550
Let's have a drink.

38:01.550 --> 38:02.590
Two!

38:02.800 --> 38:04.090
Two!

38:04.280 --> 38:05.670
Four!

38:05.880 --> 38:07.110
Two!

38:08.630 --> 38:10.430
Physician Jiu, why are you here?

38:10.480 --> 38:11.190
I heard it was so lively

38:11.190 --> 38:12.190
in the courtyard.

38:12.630 --> 38:14.490
I didn't expect you to be here too.

38:17.030 --> 38:17.760
Little bro,

38:18.220 --> 38:19.750
I have something to ask you.

38:23.230 --> 38:24.440
Who are you really?

38:34.320 --> 38:34.880
Father.

38:38.400 --> 38:39.400
You've suffered.

38:42.710 --> 38:44.170
After seeing you that day,

38:45.280 --> 38:47.810
I noticed a new mark on the Hidden Dragon Case.

38:48.560 --> 38:49.820
That's when I realized

38:51.010 --> 38:53.210
the Real-felicity Sword had been used,

38:53.800 --> 38:55.330
and it was connected to you.

38:55.400 --> 38:55.960
Either

38:56.760 --> 38:57.480
I used

38:57.700 --> 38:59.560
the Real-felicity Sword for you,

38:59.880 --> 39:00.480
or

39:01.030 --> 39:02.400
you used it yourself.

39:04.320 --> 39:05.710
But in either case,

39:08.000 --> 39:09.000
you must be

39:09.590 --> 39:10.840
someone close to me.

39:16.710 --> 39:17.490
Are you

39:18.150 --> 39:19.410
staying in Guangping?

39:22.320 --> 39:23.000
No.

39:25.710 --> 39:27.170
My father has passed away.

39:28.840 --> 39:30.960
The Mystic Panther Clan is in turmoil,

39:30.960 --> 39:33.070
the Carefree Herb is dying in large patches,

39:33.070 --> 39:35.000
and the Carefree Land is in danger.

39:36.280 --> 39:37.630
Zi Kong can't

39:38.920 --> 39:39.850
handle it alone.

39:41.030 --> 39:42.760
When will the Realm Gate close?

39:44.570 --> 39:45.310
About...

39:46.040 --> 39:47.520
less than a day left.

39:49.750 --> 39:51.010
So the next time we meet

39:52.800 --> 39:54.110
will be 12 years later.

39:58.960 --> 40:00.490
How have you been traveling

40:00.880 --> 40:03.080
between the two realms all these years?

40:10.690 --> 40:11.460
This thing

40:12.000 --> 40:13.000
is called a Taofu.

40:14.350 --> 40:16.590
It lets me move between realms.

40:17.800 --> 40:19.530
But I've used it too many times.

40:20.200 --> 40:21.130
It's broken now.

40:32.390 --> 40:33.520
Is this the only one?

40:36.150 --> 40:36.630
Yes.

40:38.990 --> 40:40.270
What about that girl

40:40.760 --> 40:41.960
from the Duan family?

40:47.710 --> 40:50.110
Everyone has their own responsibilities.

40:50.710 --> 40:51.970
We can't force things.

40:54.710 --> 40:55.860
Since the Real-felicity Sword has been drawn,

40:55.860 --> 40:58.520
you two shouldn't remember each other anymore.

40:59.480 --> 41:00.630
But that girl

41:01.440 --> 41:02.840
remembered everything.

41:05.320 --> 41:06.280
Now,

41:07.510 --> 41:09.070
I don't know whether that's a blessing

41:09.070 --> 41:09.960
or a curse.

41:13.590 --> 41:14.920
Your bonds have been severed.

41:14.920 --> 41:16.050
What's gone is gone.

41:17.190 --> 41:19.320
Don't let your mother and your brother

41:19.320 --> 41:20.670
know about this.

41:24.890 --> 41:25.590
Your brother

41:25.590 --> 41:27.320
is getting married next month.

41:28.590 --> 41:29.990
You won't make it in time.

41:32.230 --> 41:32.920
Yes.

41:36.960 --> 41:37.890
Well, that's it.

41:39.880 --> 41:41.410
Go and do what you need to do.

41:42.150 --> 41:43.000
Maybe one day,

41:44.960 --> 41:45.920
you and I

41:47.480 --> 41:48.440
will meet again.

41:54.760 --> 41:55.360
Father,

42:09.800 --> 42:10.490
I, Xuanye,

42:11.190 --> 42:13.360
thank you and Mother for raising me.

42:36.840 --> 42:37.480
Youhuang,

42:37.510 --> 42:39.710
come on, hurry up.

42:40.820 --> 42:42.150
What are you hiding for?

42:42.320 --> 42:43.670
This is between us—

42:43.670 --> 42:45.070
we know what we're doing.

42:45.320 --> 42:46.830
Do you?

42:46.850 --> 42:47.590
Alright, alright, alright.

42:47.590 --> 42:48.300
You're not young anymore...

42:48.300 --> 42:49.900
Alright, alright, alright.

43:07.360 --> 43:08.230
I'm afraid

43:08.600 --> 43:09.250
I won't make it

43:09.250 --> 43:10.290
to your wedding.

43:11.070 --> 43:11.600
This

43:11.630 --> 43:13.030
is my wedding gift to you.

43:14.150 --> 43:14.750
Thank you.

43:16.370 --> 43:18.120
I can't accept this gift.

43:18.760 --> 43:19.960
About this marriage,

43:20.880 --> 43:22.480
I still need to think it over.

43:24.320 --> 43:25.110
Miss Sima,

43:25.400 --> 43:26.260
don't mind him.

43:26.280 --> 43:27.490
This gift is for you.

43:28.080 --> 43:28.640
If one day

43:28.670 --> 43:30.000
you marry someone else,

43:30.000 --> 43:31.530
just send me an invitation.

43:32.100 --> 43:32.620
Okay.

43:34.030 --> 43:34.960
Xuanye, Banxia,

43:35.230 --> 43:37.280
let's meet again another day.

43:37.760 --> 43:39.110
Next time, come to my place,

43:39.110 --> 43:40.310
and it'll be my treat.

43:44.280 --> 43:44.880
Xuanye.

43:47.630 --> 43:48.320
Take care.

43:50.360 --> 43:50.960
Take care.

43:53.400 --> 43:55.660
Banxia, thank you for your hospitality.

43:55.800 --> 43:57.180
Farewell, Mr. Jiu.

43:57.960 --> 43:58.560
Farewell.

43:58.960 --> 43:59.590
Take care.

44:04.480 --> 44:05.580
Is this gift heavy?

44:05.800 --> 44:06.480
Let me carry it for you.

44:06.480 --> 44:07.810
It's not heavy. No need.

44:07.880 --> 44:09.140
Let me carry it for you.

44:09.760 --> 44:10.760
Why don't you show me

44:10.760 --> 44:11.620
what's inside?

44:12.200 --> 44:12.920
This is Banxia's gift

44:12.920 --> 44:14.840
for me and someone else's wedding.

44:14.840 --> 44:15.760
What does it have to do with you?

44:15.760 --> 44:16.400
What if it's very valuable?

44:16.400 --> 44:17.330
I'm leaving too.

44:20.400 --> 44:20.990
Chi Xue,

44:23.110 --> 44:25.590
from now on, take good care of your master

44:26.480 --> 44:27.670
and his wife.

44:28.440 --> 44:29.700
Don't make them angry.

44:30.230 --> 44:30.760
Also,

44:31.400 --> 44:33.070
practice your martial arts diligently.

44:33.070 --> 44:34.530
If you can't win, just run.

44:34.550 --> 44:35.610
Don't be reckless.

44:35.840 --> 44:36.570
Understand?

44:39.110 --> 44:39.670
I got it.

44:42.710 --> 44:43.240
Alright.

44:43.760 --> 44:44.420
Go back now.

44:57.510 --> 44:58.570
See me off for a bit.

45:05.110 --> 45:05.800
Tingzhou.

45:06.480 --> 45:07.880
I'm going out for a while.

45:27.800 --> 45:28.400
Xuanye,

45:29.000 --> 45:30.400
is the Carefree Land big?

45:31.480 --> 45:32.280
It's very big.

45:32.710 --> 45:34.170
Just like the human world,

45:34.500 --> 45:35.730
it has vast land,

45:36.190 --> 45:37.670
beautiful mountains and rivers,

45:37.670 --> 45:38.930
and expansive oceans.

45:39.550 --> 45:40.550
The Reversed Land

45:40.630 --> 45:41.550
is just an entrance

45:41.550 --> 45:42.750
to the Carefree Land.

45:42.920 --> 45:43.850
Further inside,

45:43.890 --> 45:45.040
it's the home

45:45.070 --> 45:46.530
of countless demon clans.

45:47.590 --> 45:48.720
So where do you live?

45:50.500 --> 45:51.960
Pass through the habitat of those

45:51.960 --> 45:53.220
powerful demon clans,

45:53.320 --> 45:54.630
and you'll reach an ice field.

45:54.630 --> 45:56.480
It's cold there, with heavy snow,

45:56.480 --> 45:58.880
and a vast ice lake stretches for miles.

45:59.440 --> 46:00.270
On the ice lake

46:00.290 --> 46:01.450
stands a royal city.

46:02.360 --> 46:03.220
That royal city

46:03.670 --> 46:06.130
is the territory of the Mystic Panther Clan.

46:07.550 --> 46:08.610
That's so far away.

46:10.630 --> 46:11.480
Yes, it is.

46:23.480 --> 46:25.410
The moon looks beautiful tonight.

46:29.510 --> 46:31.510
Is there a moon in the Carefree Land?

46:33.320 --> 46:34.120
Yes, there is.

46:39.280 --> 46:40.030
That's good.

46:41.800 --> 46:43.460
No matter how far apart we are,

46:44.910 --> 46:45.760
we'll still look at

46:45.760 --> 46:47.360
the same moon when we look up.

46:51.440 --> 46:52.030
Indeed.

47:17.230 --> 47:18.430
I'll see you off here.

47:22.320 --> 47:22.850
Alright.

47:24.670 --> 47:25.930
Take care of yourself.

47:28.150 --> 47:28.960
I will.

47:30.190 --> 47:30.800
You too.

47:33.320 --> 47:34.380
I'll be going then.

48:22.170 --> 48:24.900
♫We row across the water♫

48:25.190 --> 48:28.650
♫Bearing the turbulence of half a lifetime♫

48:29.570 --> 48:34.900
♫Crossing a river of carefree hearts♫

48:37.060 --> 48:39.650
♫Crossing a journey of greed and anger♫

48:40.210 --> 48:43.650
♫Asking how to part with what we refuse to let go♫

48:43.690 --> 48:50.640
♫Listening to the silence of time♫

48:54.390 --> 49:01.640
♫Who forgot about the ups and downs of that long night's journey?♫

49:01.970 --> 49:08.640
♫Leaving behind a pouring rain of love and hatred♫

49:09.450 --> 49:16.400
♫Who remembers what's deeply engraved by fate?♫

49:17.480 --> 49:23.390
♫A fleeting memory, yet love endures♫

49:25.400 --> 49:26.030
Xuanye,

49:26.920 --> 49:28.000
what's the name

49:28.170 --> 49:30.040
of the river we fell into together

49:30.150 --> 49:31.350
in the Carefree Land?

49:32.550 --> 49:33.210
It's called

49:33.630 --> 49:34.760
the Carefree River.

49:35.880 --> 49:37.190
The Carefree River?

49:38.690 --> 49:41.860
♫The beginning of love♫

49:39.510 --> 49:40.070
Yes.

49:40.920 --> 49:42.180
Break through the fog,

49:42.230 --> 49:43.560
find joy in bitterness,

49:43.880 --> 49:45.880
and find freedom in being carefree.

49:46.210 --> 49:48.410
♫The return is yet unknown♫

49:46.480 --> 49:47.540
That's a good name.

49:49.510 --> 49:50.110
Banxia,

49:51.480 --> 49:52.210
I'm leaving.

49:53.630 --> 49:56.660
♫Through endless days and nights♫

49:57.030 --> 49:57.670
Goodbye.

49:59.060 --> 49:59.710
Goodbye.

50:01.020 --> 50:03.470
♫Where my heart leads me to♫

50:18.770 --> 50:21.170
♫Wishing for a nice city♫

50:21.630 --> 50:24.890
♫To idle away♫

50:26.190 --> 50:32.060
♫Waiting for a light that won't go out♫

50:33.640 --> 50:36.320
♫Seeing the moon rise and set♫

50:36.770 --> 50:40.310
♫Condensing the past all into tears♫

50:40.710 --> 50:46.790
♫To reflect the passion glowing in my eyes♫

50:49.080 --> 50:55.860
♫Who is talking about never letting go of the memory♫

50:56.520 --> 51:02.760
♫Dreaming about the intertwined joy and sorrow♫

51:04.110 --> 51:11.360
♫Who knows the river of life winds through with twists and turns♫

51:12.130 --> 51:19.260
♫A fleeting memory, yet love endures♫

51:18.790 --> 51:21.650
[Heaven and earth hold love, so all things thrive without end]

51:18.790 --> 51:21.650
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]
